      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>These humanoids resemble hairless, genderless humes with no facial features and grey skin that changes color, allowing them to blend perfectly with their surroundings.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 17, touch 13; flat-footed 14 (+3 Dex, +1 natural, +3 armor)</p><p>hp 30 [48] (4d10+8)</p><p>Fort +3, Ref +7, Will +4</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Shortsword +7 (1d6+2)</p><p>Special Attacks Critical Attack, Shadow Blink, +2d6 sneak attack</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 15, Dex 17, Con 15, Int 13, Wis 11, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +4; CMB +6; CMD 19</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +7, Escape Artist +7, Perception +11, Stealth +14 (+19 with cloak); Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +4 Stealth</p><p>Languages Common, Sign Language</p><p>Gear shortsword, studded leather armor, faceless cloak (20% concealment, +5 on Stealth checks, disintegrates in sunlight)</p>"
